<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a;">
  <h1>{{.EventName}} has been updated</h1>
  <p>Hi {{.FullName}},</p>
  <p>Some details for <strong>{{.EventName}}</strong> have changed: {{.ChangedFields}}.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Event date: {{.EventDate}}</li>
    <li>Location: {{.Location}}</li>
    <li>Registration number: {{.RegistrationNumber}}</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Please make a note of the update.</p>
  <p>— Unity Run Club</p>
</body>
</html>
